	(text "GPIO V1: 0/1=I2C; 2=INA_ALERT; 4=HALL; 5/6/7=MCP42100 CS/SCK/MOSI; 8=ACTION; 20=POT_SHDN; 21=UART_TX (NC). GPIO2/8 are strap pins; pull-ups preserve boot state."
